  designNotes: "2026-09-02, Meshy AI attack (\u6B66\u58EB\u5200\u524D\u523A.zip,
    take \"Scene\", 3.03s) imported as Wushi_ThrustStab - a katana forward thrust
    (2-3 stabs). Measured offline on the live 4x \u6B66\u58EB: blade forward-reach
    spikes 5.3m at nt 0.25 (speed 36) and again nt 0.63-0.65 (speed 18-36), 6.2m
    nt 0.90. Hips forward-drift 0 -> ~4.5m baked into the body pose (NOT removable
    by lockRootPositionXZ - Meshy clip quirk), so cancelClipBodyDrift=1 anchors the
    visible body every frame and lungeDistanceFromTargetGap (gap-1.7m, clamp 0..4)
    drives a short controlled commit toward the player over nt 0.08-0.40. deflectReaction
    ContinueCombo, knockback 0 per session rules. NEEDS PLAY TUNING: hit window nt,
    lungeTargetGapMeters, and whether the drift-cancel reads clean (feet may slide
    if the clip has foot IK the anchor fights)."
